// Chapter 12 (post-game): Fragment de Code 6 (PG_Fragment).
[
    // "Under the empty stall at the back on the left": the west end of the back stalls' crates (6-8, 4),
    // (6, 4) (solid), read from (6, 5), (5, 4) or (6, 3). A sign running PG_Fragment. The "BIP" coords two
